{"id":"mmwzr2t9zra57zqst2y92uf5y","title":"昆士兰大学团队用重力发送穿透性通信消息","originalTitle":"Physicists send an unblockable message using gravity","summary":"昆士兰大学物理团队通过升降机与重力计实验，首次实现重力场编码信息并成功解码，证明重力通信可行性。实验使用1.8吨重物制造重力波动，数据传输率仅1 bit/分钟，但建模显示量子传感器可将距离扩展至500米。该成果发表于Science Advances（DOI:10.1126/sciadv.aee0802），为极端环境通信提供新思路。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-physicists-unblockable-message-gravity.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T19:00:23.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T19:15:40.397Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T19:15:40.397Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","量子计算"],"score":58,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"111330b7-3fb3-4c69-8712-ae0eb4af358d","title":"昆士兰大学团队实现重力场信息编码与解码"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"111330b7-3fb3-4c69-8712-ae0eb4af358d","title":"昆士兰大学团队实现重力场信息编码与解码"}],"topics":[{"slug":"quantum-computing","name":"量子计算"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fWSSNdyl9Gvk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}